{
  "dom_id": "step-q344474",
  "name": "Question 6",
  "problem": "The exact global maximum value of the function $f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x$ on the closed interval $0\\le x\\le 2\\pi $ is{{field-1}}.",
  "worked_solution": "Let's apply the candidates test step by step.\n\n**Step 1**: We find the critical points. Taking the derivative of $f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand solving ${f}^{′}(x)=0,$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x & =0 \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡x & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x \\\\ \\operatorname{tan}⁡x & =1 \\\\ x & =\\frac{\\pi }{4}+\\pi n,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is an integer. We discard all solutions except $x=\\frac{\\pi }{4}$ and $x=\\frac{\\pi }{4}+\\pi =\\frac{5\\pi }{4},$ since they are the only values that belong to the given interval.\n\nSo, the critical points are $x=\\frac{\\pi }{4},\\,\\frac{5\\pi }{4},$ and the endpoints $x=0,\\,2\\pi $ (since the derivative is not defined at the endpoints).\n\n**Step 2**: We evaluate $f(x)$ at the critical points.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(0) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)=1 \\\\ f\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4}) & =sin\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})+cos\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}=\\sqrt{2} \\\\ f\\,(\\frac{5\\pi }{4}) & =sin\\,(\\frac{5\\pi }{4})+cos\\,(\\frac{5\\pi }{4})=-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}=-\\sqrt{2} \\\\ f(2\\pi ) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\pi )+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\pi )=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 3**: We compare all of the values found in step $2.$\n\n- The greatest value is $f\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})=\\sqrt{2},$ so the global maximum is $\\sqrt{2}.$\n\n- The least value is $f\\,(\\frac{5\\pi }{4})=-\\sqrt{2},$ so the global minimum is $-\\sqrt{2}.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14150956/assets/e42ca640ae08d60ea81bdcb7c3c3753f5dc74fb6eea49b5b0f999e3463b5f8f0.png)",
